ss="mi" id="MathJax-Span-173" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.301em;">n</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.205em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.354em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.361em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD"><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi><mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD"><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-33">|b| = n</script>), состоящую только из символов <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-34-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow class=&quot;MJX-TeXAtom-ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mtext mathvariant=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;0&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-174" style="width: 0.658em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.539em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.372em, 1000.48em, 2.324em, -999.997em); top: -2.14em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-175"><span class="texatom" id="MathJax-Span-176"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-177"><span class="mtext" id="MathJax-Span-178" style="font-family: MathJax_Typewriter;">0</span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.146em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.932em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD"><mtext mathvariant="monospace">0</mtext></mrow></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-34">\texttt{0}</script> и/или <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-35-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow class=&quot;MJX-TeXAtom-ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mtext mathvariant=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;1&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-179" style="width: 0.658em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.539em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.372em, 1000.48em, 2.324em, -999.997em); top: -2.14em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-180"><span class="texatom" id="MathJax-Span-181"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-182"><span class="mtext" id="MathJax-Span-183" style="font-family: MathJax_Typewriter;">1</span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.146em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.861em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD"><mtext mathvariant="monospace">1</mtext></mrow></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-35">\texttt{1}</script>.</p><p>Гарантируется, что сумма <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-36-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;n&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-184" style="width: 0.717em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.598em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.551em, 1000.6em, 2.324em, -999.997em); top: -2.14em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-185"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-186" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">n</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.146em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.718em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>n</mi></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-36">n</script> по всем наборам входных данных не превышает <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-37-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mn&gt;2&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mo&gt;&amp;#x22C5;&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;msup&gt;&lt;mn&gt;10&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mn&gt;5&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/msup&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-187" style="width: 3.217em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.682em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.134em, 1002.68em, 2.384em, -999.997em); top: -2.199em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-188"><span class="mn" id="MathJax-Span-189" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">2</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-190" style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.241em;">⋅</span><span class="msubsup" id="MathJax-Span-191" style="padding-left: 0.241em;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 1.432em; height: 0px;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.158em, 1000.96em, 4.17em, -999.997em); top: -3.985em; left: 0em;"><span class="mn" id="MathJax-Span-192" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">10</span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.991em;"></span></span><span style="position: absolute; top: -4.402em; left: 1.015em;"><span class="mn" id="MathJax-Span-193" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Main;">5</span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 3.991em;"></span></span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.205em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.218em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-37">2 \cdot 10^5</script>.</p></div><div class="output-specification"><div class="section-title">Выходные данные</div><p>Для каждого набора входных данных выведите «<span class="tex-font-style-tt">YES</span>», если строку <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-38-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-194" style="width: 0.658em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.539em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.551em, 1000.54em, 2.324em, -999.997em); top: -2.14em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-195"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-196" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">a</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.146em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.718em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>a</mi></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-38">a</script> можно преобразовать в строку <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-39-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-197" style="width: 0.539em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.42em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.253em, 1000.42em, 2.324em, -999.997em); top: -2.14em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-198"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-199" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">b</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.146em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.004em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>b</mi></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-39">b</script>, выполнив конечное число операций, и «<span class="tex-font-style-tt">NO</span>» в противном случае.</p><p>Ответ можно выводить в любом регистре (верхнем или нижнем). Например, строки «<span class="tex-font-style-tt">yEs</span>», «<span class="tex-font-style-tt">yes</span>», «<span class="tex-font-style-tt">Yes</span>» и «<span class="tex-font-style-tt">YES</span>» будут распознаны как положительные ответы.</p></div><div class="sample-tests"><div class="section-title">Пример</div><div class="sample-test"><div class="input"><div class="title">Входные данные<div title="Скопировать" data-clipboard-target="#id00503252993038826" id="id007362276037314197" class="input-output-copier">Скопировать</div></div><pre id="id00503252993038826"><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-0">9</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-1" style="">1</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-1" style="">0</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-1" style="">0</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-2" style="">2</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-2" style="">01</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-2" style="">10</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-3" style="">3</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-3" style="">001</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-3" style="">100</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-4" style="">4</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-4" style="">1010</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-4" style="">0101</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-5" style="">4</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-5" style="">1100</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-5" style="">1000</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-6" style="">5</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-6" style="">01001</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-6" style="">10010</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-7" style="">6</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-7" style="">110000</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-7" style="">000011</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-8" style="">6</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-8" style="">111000</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-8" style="">000111</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-9" style="">7</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-9" style="">1001100</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-9" style="">0000111</div></pre></div><div class="output"><div class="title">Выходные данные<div title="Скопировать" data-clipboard-target="#id0019153149821538829" id="id0018907917647732486" class="input-output-copier">Скопировать</div></div><pre id="id0019153149821538829"><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-1" style="">YES</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-2" style="">NO</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-3" style="">YES</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-4" style="">NO</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-5" style="">NO</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-6" style="">YES</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-7" style="">YES</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-even test-example-line-8" style="">NO</div><div class="test-example-line test-example-line-odd test-example-line-9" style="">YES</div></pre></div></div></div><div class="note"><div class="section-title">Примечание</div><p>В первом наборе входных данных уже выполняется <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-40-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-200" style="width: 2.801em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.324em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.313em, 1002.32em, 2.384em, -999.997em); top: -2.199em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-201"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-202" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">a</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-203" style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.301em;">=</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-204" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.301em;">b</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.205em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.004em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-40">a = b</script>. Поэтому ответ — <span class="tex-font-style-tt">YES</span>.</p><p>Во втором наборе входных данных нельзя выполнить ни одной операции. Поскольку <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-41-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;&amp;#x2260;&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-205" style="width: 2.801em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.324em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.313em, 1002.32em, 2.622em, -999.997em); top: -2.199em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-206"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-207" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">a</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-208" style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.301em;">≠</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-209" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.301em;">b</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.205em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.354em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.289em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>b</mi></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-41">a \neq b</script>, ответ — <span class="tex-font-style-tt">NO</span>.</p><p>В третьем наборе входных данных можно выбрать подстроку <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-42-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;[&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;1&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mo&gt;,&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mn&gt;3&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;mo stretchy=&quot;false&quot;&gt;]&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mrow class=&quot;MJX-TeXAtom-ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mtext mathvariant=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;001&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-210" style="width: 6.61em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 5.479em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.253em, 1005.42em, 2.622em, -999.997em); top: -2.199em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-211"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-212" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">a</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-213" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">[</span><span class="mn" id="MathJax-Span-214" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">1</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-215" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">,</span><span class="mn" id="MathJax-Span-216" style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.182em;">3</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-217" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">]</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-218" style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.301em;">=</span><span class="texatom" id="MathJax-Span-219" style="padding-left: 0.301em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-220"><span class="mtext" id="MathJax-Span-221" style="font-family: MathJax_Typewriter;">001</span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.205em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.354em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.361em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD"><mtext mathvariant="monospace">001</mtext></mrow></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-42">a[1, 3] = \texttt{001}</script> и заменить её на <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-43-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow class=&quot;MJX-TeXAtom-ORD&quot;&gt;&lt;mtext mathvariant=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;100&lt;/mtext&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-222" style="width: 1.908em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 1.551em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.372em, 1001.49em, 2.324em, -999.997em); top: -2.14em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-223"><span class="texatom" id="MathJax-Span-224"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-225"><span class="mtext" id="MathJax-Span-226" style="font-family: MathJax_Typewriter;">100</span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.146em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.068em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.932em;"></span></span></nobr><span class="MJX_Assistive_MathML" role="presentation"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD"><mtext mathvariant="monospace">100</mtext></mrow></math></span></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-43">\texttt{100}</script>, получив <span class="MathJax_Preview" style="color: inherit;"></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-44-Frame" tabindex="0" style="position: relative;" data-mathml="&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mi&gt;a&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;mo&gt;=&lt;/mo&gt;&lt;mi&gt;b&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/math&gt;" role="presentation"><nobr aria-hidden="true"><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-227" style="width: 2.801em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.324em; height: 0px; font-size: 120%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.313em, 1002.32em, 2.384em, -999.997em); top: -2.199e